    rdfs:label "Ashlag, Haqdama le-Sefer ha-Zohar, Introduction to the Book of the Zohar"@en, "Aschlag, Haqdama le-Sefer ha-Zohar, Einleitung in das Buch Sohar"@de ;
    skos:note "Listed in prima-materia#924 with the Petiḥa and not opened in this run, which takes one work. Reachability not checked in this run."@en .

pmw:HaqdamaLeTalmudEserHaSefirot a dcterms:BibliographicResource ;
    rdfs:label "Ashlag, Haqdama le-Talmud Eser ha-Sefirot, with Histaklut Penimit"@en, "Aschlag, Haqdama le-Talmud Eser ha-Sefirot, mit Histaklut Penimit"@de ;
    skos:note "Listed in prima-materia#924 and not opened in this run, which takes one work. The Petiḥa refers to Talmud Eser ha-Sefirot by name at sections 1, 20 and 111, and to Or Penimi, the inner commentary of the same work, at 111. Reachability not checked in this run."@en .

